Ongoing Data Center Outage Update.

Hi there=2C

Thanks so much for hanging in with us through such a crazy week=2C it=E2=
=80=99s not all over yet but writing you now to share a quick update on ho=
w things are going in restoring our services due to the outage caused by T=
he Unfortunate Data Center Backup Generator Fire Debacle (https://whoisxml=
api.us19.list-manage.com/track/click?u=3Dac3eb198a68ff40d7e99876a9&id=3Dcf=
07781055&e=3D70c0da281a) .

You can count on us to continue listening to your feedback=2C welcoming yo=
ur questions=2C and deeply appreciating the patience and support we=E2=80=
=99ve received from the many of you reaching out.

As you can see below=2C not 100% of all products are back up in their usua=
l glory quite yet=2C but hope you find that many critical API=E2=80=99s an=
d feeds are back up and ready to go for your projects=2C processes=2C and=
 production environments.

